{"id":"n5-067","title":"いつか～","romaji":"itsuka～","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Indicates an unspecified point in time; 'someday', 'one day', 'at some point'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point いつか is used to indicate an unspecified point in time, meaning 'someday', 'one day', or 'at some point' in the future or the past. It can be used in sentences to express hopes, dreams, or possibilities.","formation":"いつか + sentence","examples":[{"jp":"いつか日本に行きたいです。","romaji":"Itsuka Nihon ni ikitai desu.","en":"I want to go to Japan someday.","words":[{"surface":"いつか","vocabId":"1268570","reading":"いつか"},{"surface":"日本","vocabId":"1582710","reading":"にほん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行き","vocabId":"1578790","reading":"いき","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"たい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0]},{"jp":"彼はいつか有名な作家になるでしょう。","romaji":"Kare wa itsuka yuumei na sakka ni naru deshou.","en":"He will become a famous writer someday.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いつか","vocabId":"1268570","reading":"いつか"},{"surface":"有名","vocabId":"1541620","reading":"ゆうめい"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"作家","vocabId":"1297510","reading":"さっか"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なる","vocabId":"1532910","reading":"なる"},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]},{"jp":"いつかあの山を登りたいと思っています。","romaji":"Itsuka ano yama wo noboritai to omotte imasu.","en":"I think I want to climb that mountain someday.","words":[{"surface":"いつか","vocabId":"1268570","reading":"いつか"},{"surface":"あの","vocabId":null},{"surface":"山","vocabId":"1302680","reading":"やま"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"登り","vocabId":"1352510","reading":"のぼり","baseForm":"登る"},{"surface":"たい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"思っ","voc